with_version.what:
https://{domain} returns the header:
Server: {server_header}
This discloses both the product and its version.

product_only.what:
https://{domain} returns the header:
Server: {server_header}
The product is disclosed but not its version.

fix.code:
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name {domain} www.{domain};
    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;
}
